--- Investigation finding (isolates the defect) ---
  - Deterministic BallSimulation ALWAYS terminates (RunPuttPhase/RunRollPhase hard step caps + ground clamp).
  - HeightmapData.SampleHeight CLAMPS off-mesh XZ (no negative sentinel).
  => y=-1582m (~18s free-fall @g) is a VISUAL/scene-layer fall-through while OnShotComplete never fires; NOT the protected deterministic sim.
  - Subagent ac4e42d2 tracing visual-application layer (PhysicsLabController/HoleSessionDriver/BotDriver) for exact defect.

=== iter-2 finding: putter fix DONE, but a SECOND blocker gates the video ===
- Root-caused the putter-underground bug: BotDriver lacked the off-green putter guard that
  VersusBot (H3b) and the real game (PutterModeSurfaceController) already have. A putt fired
  from a Fairway lie is misrouted to SimulateAirborne, whose origin sits on/below the sim
  ground → airborne crossing-guard never fires → ball free-falls (~18s @g = y≈-1582). Real
  players CAN'T putt off-green (UI reverts club); the bot was the lone harness that could.
- FIX (bot-harness only, ZERO deterministic-physics change): ported the off-green putter guard
  into BotDriver.PlayHoleToCup — putter off-green → Wedge chip. Compiles clean.
- TEST RUN (audio_gameplay_shots, LIVE path, default char James): revealed a SEPARATE
  pre-existing blocker. BotDriver.SelectShot power table is tuned for neutral/FALLBACK stats;
  with James's LIVE stats (F7 velocity lane) every shot overshoots ~40% (Driver ~375m,
  Wedge@0.75 ~264m). Ball oscillates across the map, never reaches the green; hits the par+3=8
  cap → ForceShotComplete FAKES an InCup (holed=seam, not a real hole-out). My off-green guard
  fired 0× because the ball never got within putter range.
- CONCLUSION: F9 is provably safe (FALLBACK bit-identical; LIVE = no-op at match start + minor
  cone). The ≤7-stroke completion VIDEO is blocked by TWO compounding pre-existing BOT
  deficiencies (LIVE-path overshoot + off-green putt fall-through), both orthogonal to F9 and
  present at HEAD. A real completion video now requires re-calibrating BotDriver's LIVE power
  table — a bot-tuning project beyond "delete two lanes" / "fix the putter bug". Reassessing w/ Cesar.

